{"seq":56,"slug":"realtime-communication-protocols","title":"实时通信协议","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实时通信协议\">实时通信协议</h1><p>打开一个协作文档，别人的光标在你眼前跳动；下单成功的那一刻，行情数字几乎与交易所同步刷新；视频通话里一句话从对方嘴边到你的耳朵只隔了几十毫秒。这些体验背后，是一整套与传统「请求—响应」截然不同的通信范式：服务器不再只会被动应答，而要主动、持续、低延迟地把变化推到客户端。本 hub 讲的就是支撑这类体验的协议、模式与工程实践。</p>\n<p>为什么这件事值得单独成册？因为 HTTP 的请求—响应模型天生不适合「服务器有话要说」的场景。绕开它的尝试经历了从短轮询到长轮询、再到真正双向连接的漫长演进，每一步都在用延迟、连接数、复杂度三者做权衡。理解这条演进线，比直接背诵某个协议的 API 更重要——它解释了为什么 WebSocket 长这样，也解释了为什么 SSE 至今没有被淘汰。</p>\n<p>全书按四章层层递进。第一章「基础」铺设地基：实时到底意味着什么样的延迟与语义，推拉模型如何取舍，以及「有状态长连接」这一核心抽象带来的全部好处与全部麻烦。第二章「协议」把三种主流实时传输讲透——双向通用的 WebSocket、单向轻量的 Server-Sent Events、点对点低延迟的 WebRTC——并讲清各自的适用边界。第三章「模式」上升到应用架构：消息如何扇出给海量订阅者、在线状态与共享状态如何同步、单机连接数撞到天花板后如何横向扩展。第四章「生产」收口于落地：断线重连与消息可靠性、实时链路特有的安全威胁、以及自建与托管服务之间的现实抉择。</p>\n<p>四条主线贯穿始终：延迟与连接的物理约束、状态在何处保存、消息送达的可靠性保证、以及规模带来的非线性成本。读完你应当能独立判断：一个具体场景该选哪种协议、用什么扇出拓扑、如何扛住断线、何时该买而非自建。</p>\n<p>各篇之间大量相互引用，请把它当成一张网而非一摞孤立卡片来读。建议从基础顺序读起；若你已有背景，也可直接跳到关心的协议或模式，再顺着交叉链接回填缺口。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realtime-overview","title":"实时通信的需求与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/foundations/realtime-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"polling-vs-push","title":"轮询、长轮询与推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/foundations/polling-vs-push"},{"seq":3,"slug":"connection-models","title":"连接模型与有状态连接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/foundations/connection-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"协议","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"websocket","title":"WebSocket 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/protocols/websocket"},{"seq":2,"slug":"server-sent-events","title":"Server-Sent Events 服务器推送事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/protocols/server-sent-events"},{"seq":3,"slug":"webrtc","title":"WebRTC 点对点通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/protocols/webrtc"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pubsub-fanout","title":"发布订阅与消息扇出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/patterns/pubsub-fanout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"presence-sync","title":"在线状态与状态同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/patterns/presence-sync"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scaling-connections","title":"海量长连接的扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/patterns/scaling-connections"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production","title":"生产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reliability-reconnection","title":"可靠性与断线重连","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/production/reliability-reconnection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"security-realtime","title":"实时通信安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/production/security-realtime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime-infra","title":"实时基础设施与托管服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/realtime-communication-protocols/production/realtime-infra"}]}]}